        <textile-connector:sourceLocator xml:lang="en">JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, printed page 15, lines 190-196; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 9.2.4, printed page 130, lines 3488-3495.</textile-connector:sourceLocator>
